### Code

```python
data = {
    "P001": {"name": "Ali", "height": 170, "weight": 70, "bmi": 24},
    "P002": {"name": "Ahmed", "height": 180, "weight": 80, "bmi": 25},
    "P003": {"name": "Sameed", "height": 160, "weight": 60, "bmi": 23}
