## Easy Notes

```text
sorted(iterable, key=None, reverse=False)

iterable -> Data to sort

key      -> Sort based on this value

reverse  -> Sorting direction

False    -> Ascending

True     -> Descending
```

### Memory Trick

```text
sorted(
    WHAT to sort,
    HOW to sort,
    WHICH direction
)
```

or

```text
sorted(
    iterable,
    key,
    reverse
)
```

These are the three parameters you'll use 99% of the time in FastAPI/Python projects.
